<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Aryan Shanker — Game developer & 3D artist</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#eceef1;--ink:#15171b;--mute:#5d6470;--line:#d3d7dd;--card:#f8f9fb;--accent:#2b4bff;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#121418;--ink:#eef0f3;--mute:#9aa1ad;--line:#2a2e36;--card:#1a1d23;--accent:#7f95ff}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#121418;--ink:#eef0f3;--mute:#9aa1ad;--line:#2a2e36;--card:#1a1d23;--accent:#7f95ff}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);scroll-behavior:smooth}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Schibsted Grotesk",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(1.25rem,4vw,2.5rem)}
header.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:1.5rem 0}
header.top b{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em}
nav a{margin-left:1.5rem;text-decoration:none;color:var(--mute);font-size:.95rem}
nav a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.hero{padding:clamp(3rem,9vw,7rem) 0 clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem)}
h1{font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(3.2rem,12vw,9.5rem);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0}
.lede{max-width:34rem;margin:2rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2.2vw,1.45rem);line-height:1.45;color:var(--mute)}
.lede strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}
figure{margin:0}
figure img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;cursor:zoom-in;background:var(--card)}
figcaption{margin-top:.6rem;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--mute)}
.lead-img img{border-radius:10px}
section{padding:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem) 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.9rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 .75rem}
.intro{max-width:36rem;color:var(--mute);margin:0 0 2.25rem}
.grid{display:grid;gap:1.25rem}
.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
.g2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
.video{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,3.5rem);align-items:center}
.play{position:relative;display:block;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1b1f2b,#2b3350 60%,#3b4a8a);text-decoration:none}
.play::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:84px;height:84px;margin:-42px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;transition:transform .25s}
.play::before{content:"";position:absolute;z-index:1;left:50%;top:50%;margin:-14px 0 0 -8px;border-left:26px solid #15171b;border-top:16px solid transparent;border-bottom:16px solid transparent}
.play:hover::after{transform:scale(1.1)}
.play span{position:absolute;left:1.25rem;bottom:1rem;color:#fff;font-weight:500;font-size:.95rem;opacity:.85}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:1.25rem;padding:.8rem 1.4rem;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500}
.btn:hover{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.tools{display:flex;gap:2rem;flex-wrap:wrap;color:var(--mute)}
.tools b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}
.sub{margin:3rem 0 1rem;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:3rem 0 4rem}
footer p{margin:0 0 .4rem}
footer .big{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,4vw,2.6rem);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.03em}
dialog{border:0;padding:0;background:transparent;max-width:96vw;max-height:94vh}
dialog::backdrop{background:rgba(8,9,12,.88)}
dialog img{max-width:96vw;max-height:90vh;border-radius:6px;display:block}
@media(max-width:860px){.g3,.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.video{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:560px){.g2,.g3,.g4{grid-template-columns:1fr}nav a{margin-left:1rem}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
.stills figure img{aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<header class="top"><b>Aryan Shanker</b>
<nav><a href="#animation">Animation</a><a href="#ship">Spaceship</a><a href="#godot">Godot</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav></header>

<div class="hero">
<h1>Aryan<br>Shanker</h1>
<p class="lede">Game developer and 3D artist. I <strong>model and animate in Blender</strong> and <strong>build games in Godot</strong>.</p>
</div>

<figure class="lead-img"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Blender model of a large spaceship exterior with turrets and engine pods"><figcaption>Spaceship exterior, modelled in Blender. About 78k triangles.</figcaption></figure>
</div>

<section id="animation"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Animation</h2>
<p class="intro">A short animated film where everything, from the modelling to the animation, was made in Blender. Stills from the film below.</p>
<div class="grid g3 stills">
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Boy in an orange hoodie standing under a street lamp at night" loading="lazy"></figure>
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Long-haired man in a green shirt typing at a glowing computer" loading="lazy"></figure>
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Two police officers speaking with the man in the green shirt" loading="lazy"></figure>
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Two men in blue jackets facing a brick wall and a closed door" loading="lazy"></figure>
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="A man lying spread-eagled on a cobbled street" loading="lazy"></figure>
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="The man in the green shirt and another man walking down steps, an officer behind them" loading="lazy"></figure>
</div>
<a class="btn" href="https://youtu.be/uVt8VUlsFfI" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch the full animation on YouTube</a>
</div></section>

<section id="ship"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Spaceship interior</h2>
<p class="intro">The inside of the same ship, built room by room in Blender: crew quarters, a control wall and corridors with storage.</p>
<div class="grid g3">
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Crew quarters with three beds and wall lockers" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Crew quarters</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Wall of panels, consoles and cabinets" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Control wall</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Corridor with doorway, storage shelves and drawers" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Corridor and storage</figcaption></figure>
</div></div></section>

<section id="godot"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Games in Godot</h2>
<p class="intro">Systems, worlds and multiplayer, all built in the Godot engine.</p>

<h3 class="sub">Random island generation</h3>
<div class="grid g4">
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Red alien world with dark grass under a starry sky" loading="lazy"></figure>
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Bright green world with tall grass" loading="lazy"></figure>
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Galactic navigation screen with route map over grassy terrain" loading="lazy"></figure>
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Rust-coloured dunes with grass at dusk" loading="lazy"></figure>
</div>
<p class="intro" style="margin-top:1rem">Each island is generated at random, with its own terrain, grass and sky.</p>

<div class="grid g2" style="margin-top:3rem">
<div><h3 class="sub" style="margin-top:0">Level design</h3>
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Moonlit pine forest at night in the Godot game Multiplayer Sheep" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Night forest from Multiplayer Sheep</figcaption></figure></div>
<div><h3 class="sub" style="margin-top:0">Building system</h3>
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Godot editor running a game with a translucent blue building preview" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Placement preview running inside the Godot editor</figcaption></figure></div>
</div>

<h3 class="sub">Multiplayer test</h3>
<figure style="max-width:760px"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Cartoon character standing in a grassy field with tall dark trees" loading="lazy"><figcaption>An early multiplayer test scene</figcaption></figure>
</div></section>

<footer id="contact"><div class="wrap">
<p class="big">Aryan Shanker</p>
<p style="color:var(--mute)">Blender for 3D modelling and animation. Godot for everything else.</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://youtu.be/uVt8VUlsFfI" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch the animation</a>
</div></footer>

<dialog id="lb"><img alt=""></dialog>
<script>
var lb=document.getElementById('lb'),li=lb.querySelector('img');
document.querySelectorAll('figure img').forEach(function(i){i.addEventListener('click',function(){li.src=i.src;li.alt=i.alt;lb.showModal()})});
lb.addEventListener('click',function(){lb.close()});
</script>
</body>
</html>
